      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "question_fzMaty": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I know this artwork is authentic?",
            "answer": "<p>Every LEGXI × Arshdeep Singh Gold-Plated Artwork is 100% authentic. LEGXI is a certified collectible brand, co-invested by Indian cricketer Arshdeep Singh himself. Each canvas is personally hand-signed and comes with a Certificate of Authenticity, verifying its signature, edition number, and provenance.</p>",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 24,
            "mobile_icon_width": 20
          }
        },
        "question_zn6QHg": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Why is this a Limited Edition?",
            "answer": "<p>This edition is strictly limited to only 92 ever created worldwide. Each artwork is individually numbered and verified, making it a rare collectible of enduring value.As a Limited Edition, it remains exclusive, investment-secure, and appreciating in value over time, a true asset for passionate collectors and cricketing connoisseurs.</p>",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 24,
            "mobile_icon_width": 20
          }
        },
        "question_GABWk9": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What makes this artwork special?",
            "answer": "<p>Each masterpiece is gold-plated and personally hand-signed by Arshdeep Singh, capturing his journey from humble beginnings to World Cup glory. It’s not just art - it’s a legacy immortalized in gold, crafted to inspire generations.</p><p>This canvas on your wall is designed to ignite the spark within you - to inspire you to create your own LEGXI.</p>",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 24,
            "mobile_icon_width": 20
          }
        },
        "question_Awn8mF": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What comes along with the artwork?",
            "answer": "<p>Your collectible arrives in premium LEGXI packaging, designed for a ceremonial unboxing experience. Inside, you’ll find the gold-plated artwork, a Certificate of Authenticity, and protective casing to ensure flawless presentation and safety.</p>",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 24,
            "mobile_icon_width": 20
          }
        },
        "question_irJwYR": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "When will I receive my collectible?",
            "answer": "<p>Once your ownership is confirmed, your artwork will be delivered within 7–10 business days in premium LEGXI packaging, complete with authentication and protective casing.</p>",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 24,
            "mobile_icon_width": 20
          }
        },
        "question_fDx7W6": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I get a unique edition number?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, you can claim a unique edition number for your collectible. Each LEGXI piece is part of a numbered limited edition series, ensuring authenticity and exclusivity.While edition numbers are not assigned on a first-come basis, our expert team will personally connect with you after registration to explain the selection process and assist you in securing your own personal edition number. Once claimed, that number becomes exclusively yours- forever</p>",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 24,
